            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is categorized as a contributing Property; it is in the United States and was established in 2000. The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is located in the municipality of Gettysburg in Pennsylvania, Adams County, which is to the east of Franklin County and northwest of Carroll County, Maryland."
